### Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3333/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "usuarioteste10@email.com",
  "password": "Senha@123"
}

### Listar minhas sessões ativas
# @name mySessions
GET http://localhost:3333/api/sessions/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Encerrar uma sessão (a primeira da lista)
DELETE http://localhost:3333/api/sessions/me/{{mySessions.response.body.$[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Sessão inexistente (deve retornar 404)
DELETE http://localhost:3333/api/sessions/me/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
